<title>USA: IPO PRICING - VDI prices within range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - VDI prices within range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			VDI Media Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					  $7</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	   $6.5 - $7.5</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			2,800,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	Prudential Securities</p>
<p>NOTE: The company revised the proposed price range for its planned initial public offering to $6.50 to $7.50 from $8 to $10 and $10 to $12 -- its original proposed price range.</p>
<p>Of the total number of shares proposed, 2.6 million will be sold by the company and the balance will be offered by selling shareholders, according to the company's prospectus.</p>
</text>
